WEBVTT

01:13.000 --> 01:17.280
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.440 --> 01:22.100
[Episode 02]

02:39.464 --> 02:40.743
What can I do for you?

02:40.744 --> 02:42.024
No, thanks.

03:08.904 --> 03:09.904
Stop!

03:11.664 --> 03:12.904
Sorry.

03:13.784 --> 03:14.784
Stop there!

03:30.944 --> 03:32.264
Here it is.

03:33.624 --> 03:35.023
Thank you, young boy.

03:35.024 --> 03:36.943
Do you want to live here?

03:36.944 --> 03:37.663
Yes.

03:37.664 --> 03:40.504
Then do you know Hulu's mom?

03:41.384 --> 03:43.264
Who is Hulu?

03:43.704 --> 03:44.423
Tuotuo!

03:44.424 --> 03:45.584
Tuotuo!

03:46.744 --> 03:48.823
Here she is.

03:48.824 --> 03:50.023
We'll play at Guobao's home.

03:50.024 --> 03:50.903
Will you join us?

03:50.904 --> 03:52.383
Yes. Wait for me.

03:52.384 --> 03:53.544
Let's go.

03:54.104 --> 03:55.584
Take care.

04:03.704 --> 04:04.864
Is anyone here?

04:24.544 --> 04:25.544
Hello.

04:26.264 --> 04:28.544
Do you know Xie Xiaochun?

04:32.184 --> 04:33.184
Hello.

04:44.424 --> 04:45.424
Hello.

04:45.704 --> 04:47.063
Are you Xu Hongdou?

04:47.064 --> 04:48.423
Are you Xie Xiaochun?

04:48.424 --> 04:50.304
Why do you come yourself?

04:51.144 --> 04:54.903
I thought you should
arrive but you didn't call me

04:54.904 --> 04:57.024
and I failed to call you.

04:57.504 --> 04:58.783
Was it hard to find?

04:58.784 --> 05:00.264
My phone was broken.

05:01.064 --> 05:02.023
Oh, I see.

05:02.024 --> 05:03.063
Is that your case?

05:03.064 --> 05:03.663
Yes.

05:03.664 --> 05:04.864
Let me help you move.

05:05.184 --> 05:06.463
No, thanks. I can do it myself.

05:06.464 --> 05:07.463
Oh, come on.

05:07.464 --> 05:08.944
You've moved for a while.

05:11.104 --> 05:11.663
It's heavy.

05:11.664 --> 05:13.624
Yeah, I agree with you.

05:13.904 --> 05:14.383
Come on.

05:14.384 --> 05:16.103
One, two, three.

05:16.104 --> 05:17.104
All right.

05:17.304 --> 05:18.304
Let's go.

05:21.864 --> 05:23.824
It's a large yard, right?

05:24.264 --> 05:25.584
Yes.

05:27.024 --> 05:29.423
Not one homestead forms it.

05:29.424 --> 05:30.383
There are three.

05:30.384 --> 05:31.744
Two years ago,

05:32.464 --> 05:34.663
we rented the place
and renovated it.

05:34.664 --> 05:36.823
Then we turned it into a short-rent yard.

05:36.824 --> 05:38.543
There are six rooms here.

05:38.544 --> 05:39.963
Here's yours.

05:39.964 --> 05:41.563
The one in Room Five
adjacent to you had lived here

05:41.564 --> 05:42.903
for five months. Just checked out.

05:42.904 --> 05:44.703
No one moves in now.

05:44.704 --> 05:47.783
The other rooms are full.

05:47.784 --> 05:51.143
If you want to renew three months later,

05:51.144 --> 05:53.143
tell me half a month in advance.

05:53.144 --> 05:54.144
Okay.

05:56.144 --> 05:57.624
Have a look.

06:00.584 --> 06:01.584
I see.

06:01.824 --> 06:05.463
You have some packages.

06:05.464 --> 06:08.423
I've collected them for you.

06:08.424 --> 06:09.343
You can have a check.

06:09.344 --> 06:09.903
Okay.

06:09.904 --> 06:10.983
Thank you.

06:10.984 --> 06:11.743
Come on, Hongdou.

06:11.744 --> 06:13.344
Let me give you a brief rundown.

06:14.704 --> 06:17.783
Here's our public kitchen.

06:17.784 --> 06:21.223
All appliances and
cooking facilities are available.

06:21.224 --> 06:22.424
For public use.

06:22.824 --> 06:25.223
There's a tearoom over there.

06:25.224 --> 06:29.504
A utility room and a
tool shed are behind it.

06:30.064 --> 06:30.903
Pretty nice.

06:30.904 --> 06:32.144
Let's come inside.

06:34.584 --> 06:37.624
Here's our dining hall.

06:38.344 --> 06:41.984
Passing through it,
there's a rest area.

06:43.144 --> 06:47.383
If you meet something or
need help when I'm not here,

06:47.384 --> 06:49.023
you can go to ask Nana.

06:49.024 --> 06:50.584
She's in Room No.1.

06:51.824 --> 06:53.303
She's now at the cafe.

06:53.304 --> 06:55.863
I'll introduce her to you later.

06:55.864 --> 06:56.864
Okay.

06:59.584 --> 07:00.944
Who's he?

07:02.384 --> 07:04.144
He lives in Room No. 2. Just ignore him.

07:05.784 --> 07:07.063
That's all for our yard.

07:07.064 --> 07:07.743
Fine.

07:07.744 --> 07:08.963
Then I have to leave now.

07:08.964 --> 07:09.823
Thank you, Xiaochun.

07:09.824 --> 07:10.824
You're welcome.

07:11.304 --> 07:14.504
Oh, a boy was running after a horse in the town.

07:15.144 --> 07:16.944
He knocked off my phone and then ran away.

07:17.224 --> 07:18.984
Running after a horse?

07:19.384 --> 07:20.783
What does he look like?

07:20.784 --> 07:23.224
He's quite young, thin and tall.

07:24.344 --> 07:26.303
I know who he is.

07:26.304 --> 07:27.143
He lives quite near.

07:27.144 --> 07:28.163
Just at the neighbor lane.

07:28.164 --> 07:29.304
Let me bring you there.

07:29.584 --> 07:30.463
Thanks.

07:30.464 --> 07:31.664
It's fine. Let's go.

07:32.904 --> 07:33.543
Watch out.

07:33.544 --> 07:34.544
Fine.

07:39.384 --> 07:40.664
Here we're.

07:41.904 --> 07:42.904
Come on.

07:44.944 --> 07:48.063
He lives here.

07:48.064 --> 07:51.264
He has a grandma
and an elder brother.

07:52.024 --> 07:53.064
Excuse me.

07:55.264 --> 07:56.264
Hello?

07:57.984 --> 07:58.623
Fine, I see.

07:58.624 --> 07:59.863
I'll be right back.

07:59.864 --> 08:00.864
Okay.

08:01.264 --> 08:02.063
Hongdou.

08:02.064 --> 08:03.103
I can't go with you.

08:03.104 --> 08:04.503
I have something urgent.

08:04.504 --> 08:07.023
When you get in,
just go to find his brother.

08:07.024 --> 08:07.623
I see.

08:07.624 --> 08:08.623
Thank you so much.

08:08.624 --> 08:09.183
I'll leave you to it.

08:09.184 --> 08:10.184
OK.

08:10.224 --> 08:13.903
If you're free,
I'll treat you to coffee tomorrow.

08:13.904 --> 08:14.904
Fine.

08:15.304 --> 08:15.863
See you then.

08:15.864 --> 08:16.864
See you.

08:18.304 --> 08:19.343
Bye bye.

08:19.344 --> 08:20.344
Bye.

08:25.104 --> 08:27.304
So many horses,
why must Lil Cute?

08:27.544 --> 08:29.463
You've just recovered from the last injury.

08:29.464 --> 08:30.703
The scratch just healed.

08:30.704 --> 08:32.343
How can you let it escape this time?

08:32.344 --> 08:33.623
Luckily, it didn't hurt anyone.

08:33.624 --> 08:35.344
Otherwise, I'll break your leg.

08:35.704 --> 08:37.064
How can you eat first?

08:37.304 --> 08:38.384
Does she start?

08:39.744 --> 08:42.023
Besides, go to have a haircut.

08:42.024 --> 08:43.303
Look at yourself!

08:43.304 --> 08:45.304
Am I not handsome?

08:46.144 --> 08:47.184
Go to cut it!

08:48.464 --> 08:50.384
Granny! Look at him!

08:50.704 --> 08:52.144
Time to eat.

09:00.144 --> 09:01.344
Excuse me?

09:01.784 --> 09:04.624
I didn't find your
doorbell so I just came in.

09:06.664 --> 09:07.923
Are you a tourist?

09:07.924 --> 09:09.223
Missing your way?

09:09.224 --> 09:10.304
I came to find him.

09:12.184 --> 09:13.184
Me?

09:14.004 --> 09:16.024
He knocked into me
while chasing his horse this morning.

09:18.224 --> 09:19.583
The horse knocked into you?

09:19.584 --> 09:21.223
Not the horse!

09:21.224 --> 09:22.503
The horse didn't bump into me.

09:22.504 --> 09:25.023
He knocked into me
while chasing the horse.

09:25.024 --> 09:26.743
Then my phone was knocked off.

09:26.744 --> 09:27.904
It's broken.

09:30.744 --> 09:32.904
Is your phone broken?

09:43.424 --> 09:47.703
You concealed your mistake
and let her come to find us.

09:47.704 --> 09:50.583
Do you only know to bring me trouble?

09:50.584 --> 09:51.023
Brother!

09:51.024 --> 09:52.663
What a troublemaker you are!

09:52.664 --> 09:55.263
Don't beat me! I know I'm wrong!

09:55.264 --> 09:55.783
Stop there!

09:55.784 --> 09:56.383
Forgive me!

09:56.384 --> 09:56.783
Stop!

09:56.784 --> 09:57.343
I'm so sorry!

09:57.344 --> 09:57.863
Don't move!

09:57.864 --> 10:00.023
Forgive me, brother! Help me!

10:00.024 --> 10:01.183
Please forgive me!

10:01.184 --> 10:02.584
- Stop there!
- Don't!

10:03.624 --> 10:04.983
Granny! Help me!

10:04.984 --> 10:07.624
Granny!

10:12.464 --> 10:15.944
The screen is crushed
and you can't open it.

10:16.504 --> 10:18.103
Do you want to fix it?

10:18.104 --> 10:19.504
Or you want a new one?

10:19.744 --> 10:21.023
Just fix it.

10:21.024 --> 10:22.663
Something important in it.

10:22.664 --> 10:25.463
If it can't be fixed,
just give me half of the money

10:25.464 --> 10:27.144
for I've used it for a year.

10:29.184 --> 10:31.903
We have to fix it at Old Town.

10:31.904 --> 10:33.063
How long will you stay here?

10:33.064 --> 10:34.263
For a while.

10:34.264 --> 10:36.464
He knocked into me on my first day here.

10:38.064 --> 10:39.423
Who brings you here?

10:39.424 --> 10:40.463
Xie Xiaochun.

10:40.464 --> 10:41.584
Xiaochun?

10:42.144 --> 10:43.504
So you live in Youfeng Yard?

10:46.464 --> 10:47.903
My name is Xie Zhiyao.

10:47.904 --> 10:48.904
What's your name?

10:53.664 --> 10:54.744
Xu Hongdou.

10:58.104 --> 11:00.583
I still have work to do
so I can't go with you.

11:00.584 --> 11:01.863
I'll find one to go with you.

11:01.864 --> 11:02.503
It doesn't matter.

11:02.504 --> 11:04.143
I have to tidy my room first.

11:04.144 --> 11:05.503
I can go myself tomorrow.

11:05.504 --> 11:06.863
I'll show you the receipt.

11:06.864 --> 11:07.623
Okay?

11:07.624 --> 11:08.624
Fine.

11:08.904 --> 11:09.903
I'm sorry for that.

11:09.904 --> 11:11.043
It's fine.

11:11.044 --> 11:12.044
Wait a second!

11:14.424 --> 11:15.544
Xie Zhiyuan!

11:16.584 --> 11:17.584
Come here.

11:25.464 --> 11:26.704
Apologize to her.

11:28.904 --> 11:29.904
Sorry.

11:30.424 --> 11:31.263
Be serious!

11:31.264 --> 11:32.943
- I'm sorry!
- Don't force him.

11:32.944 --> 11:34.304
I've forgiven her.

11:34.904 --> 11:35.663
We're so sorry.

11:35.664 --> 11:36.223
It's fine.

11:36.224 --> 11:37.224
Sorry!

11:37.624 --> 11:38.943
Don't beat him.

11:38.944 --> 11:40.304
I didn't.

11:45.864 --> 11:46.984
Did I beat you?

11:48.304 --> 11:49.423
Granny!

11:49.424 --> 11:51.664
He pinched my neck
and kicked my ass!

11:52.104 --> 11:53.344
Look at here!

11:53.784 --> 11:55.183
It's okay.

11:55.184 --> 11:56.504
It does hurt.

11:58.784 --> 12:00.383
What does she want?

12:00.384 --> 12:01.503
Fix it first.

12:01.504 --> 12:02.923
If not, just give her half of the money

12:02.924 --> 12:04.224
for she's used it for a year.

12:05.144 --> 12:06.503
She's an honest girl.

12:06.504 --> 12:07.083
Yes.

12:07.084 --> 12:08.864
She didn't ask me to buy a new one.

12:09.304 --> 12:11.183
He hates to buy me a new phone.

12:11.184 --> 12:12.903
I'm now using his former one.

12:12.904 --> 12:14.103
So mean.

12:14.104 --> 12:16.424
Why does a student need a new phone?

12:16.864 --> 12:17.823
It's hard to play games.

12:17.824 --> 12:19.103
They scolded me about it.

12:19.104 --> 12:21.143
Don't play with those people.

12:21.144 --> 12:22.304
So rude.

12:22.664 --> 12:24.224
You can't get what I mean.

12:26.384 --> 12:27.384
Wait!

12:28.584 --> 12:30.704
Don't bully him.

12:31.624 --> 12:32.624
Have the meal.

12:41.864 --> 12:43.024
Hello?

12:43.264 --> 12:44.704
How about wood carving paintings?

12:49.304 --> 12:51.983
How can machines be the same as humans?

12:51.984 --> 12:53.383
Machines mold.

12:53.384 --> 12:54.823
Make the boxwood mundane.

12:54.824 --> 12:56.544
Nothing unique.

12:59.304 --> 13:01.744
Is it the result of your discussion?

13:04.064 --> 13:05.463
Try more.

13:05.464 --> 13:07.984
Can't we eat peacefully?

13:08.304 --> 13:09.704
Granny, try this.

13:38.384 --> 13:39.583
Granny Xiuying.

13:39.584 --> 13:40.984
Please clean the horse's dung.

13:43.504 --> 13:44.584
Sis.

13:45.504 --> 13:47.304
You forgot to clean it again.

13:49.704 --> 13:52.024
I forgot about it. Well...

13:52.744 --> 13:53.744
Forget it.

13:53.904 --> 13:54.904
I'll clean it.

14:07.344 --> 14:08.943
Xiaochun, did you get her?

14:08.944 --> 14:09.623
Yes.

14:09.624 --> 14:11.023
She looks so kind.

14:11.024 --> 14:12.704
Her name and her job?

14:13.824 --> 14:14.983
She's called Xu Hongdou.

14:14.984 --> 14:16.704
I didn't get her job yet.

14:25.344 --> 14:26.463
Haven't you had lunch?

14:26.464 --> 14:28.463
Damai and I tried to make
some steamed stuffed buns.

14:28.464 --> 14:29.903
I'll bring some to Xiaxia.

14:29.904 --> 14:31.103
You don't need to worry about him.

14:31.104 --> 14:32.264
It doesn't matter.

14:35.504 --> 14:36.504
Look at it.

14:37.124 --> 14:37.623
Look at it!

14:37.624 --> 14:38.624
Ying

14:39.424 --> 14:42.824
I don't know what you're doing every day!

14:43.264 --> 14:43.543
See!

14:43.544 --> 14:44.543
What's going on?

14:44.544 --> 14:46.143
His master has blamed him for a while.

14:46.144 --> 14:47.544
He thinks he's idle.

14:50.784 --> 14:51.720
See!

14:51.744 --> 14:53.424
How did I teach you?

14:53.984 --> 14:56.303
Do you think you've
become professional

14:56.304 --> 14:57.663
after learning with me?

14:57.664 --> 15:01.864
Do you think you're capable
enough so you have time to play?

15:02.904 --> 15:04.303
It's my creation.

15:04.304 --> 15:06.384
Creation? By your skills?

15:07.504 --> 15:08.543
Listen!

15:08.544 --> 15:13.784
When I was at your age,
many people craved to hire me!

15:14.464 --> 15:16.143
Look at the door plank!

15:16.144 --> 15:17.384
How long have you used it?

15:18.384 --> 15:20.504
Then look at the flower!

15:21.464 --> 15:23.024
Are you still in the dream?

15:23.504 --> 15:24.784
I haven't finished it yet.

15:26.024 --> 15:27.224
Fickle!

15:28.304 --> 15:29.823
Fidget!

15:29.824 --> 15:32.383
You only know to play with your phone
and surf the internet!

15:32.384 --> 15:33.263
Not serious.

15:33.264 --> 15:35.664
Your mind is not here!

15:36.384 --> 15:39.944
How can you fly
without learning basics?

15:42.304 --> 15:43.384
I'm sorry, master.

15:45.424 --> 15:47.904
You're always well-mannered at it

15:48.264 --> 15:49.624
but you don't correct them.

15:53.644 --> 15:54.904
Why are you goggling at me?

15:59.944 --> 16:02.023
Please keep calm. I'll tell you the truth.

16:02.024 --> 16:03.144
Truth?

16:04.144 --> 16:06.024
So you only told me lies?

16:07.144 --> 16:08.144
Fine.

16:08.304 --> 16:09.304
Go ahead.

16:09.824 --> 16:10.824
Come on.

16:14.464 --> 16:15.784
Say it!

16:17.904 --> 16:20.504
If the wood carving can be sold,
I promise I'll be serious.

16:21.544 --> 16:23.183
You've worked on it for decades

16:23.184 --> 16:25.063
and you're a state-level inheritor.

16:25.064 --> 16:26.623
Your work "Follow Shape"

16:26.624 --> 16:27.904
has been here two years ago.

16:28.304 --> 16:29.624
It becomes the guardian here.

16:30.144 --> 16:31.264
And the chair outside.

16:32.024 --> 16:35.063
Everyone comes and
touches it but no one buys it.

16:35.064 --> 16:37.023
But numerous people come to see it.

16:37.024 --> 16:38.263
As long as our skills are...

16:38.264 --> 16:39.183
Useless.

16:39.184 --> 16:40.463
They only come to snap.

16:40.464 --> 16:43.784
It'll be nice for them
to buy some gadgets.

16:44.384 --> 16:47.103
All your and others' works are all here.

16:47.104 --> 16:48.983
It's hard to sell them.

16:48.984 --> 16:50.903
I don't think you should set up such a shop.

16:50.904 --> 16:52.223
It's the same to sell online.

16:52.224 --> 16:53.384
Without so many costs.

16:54.024 --> 16:54.583
You...

16:54.584 --> 16:55.584
Xiaxia.

16:58.304 --> 16:59.584
Uncle is also here.

17:12.224 --> 17:14.424
Though he's old,
he's still irritable.

17:17.904 --> 17:19.664
No wonder he gets angry.

17:19.984 --> 17:21.504
I also think you're lazy.

17:22.384 --> 17:24.543
He's unhappy so
nothing satisfies him.

17:24.544 --> 17:26.144
Wasn't it you who made him angry?

17:26.584 --> 17:27.663
Not me.

17:27.664 --> 17:29.064
My junior fellow apprentice.

17:30.064 --> 17:31.584
Forget it. It's boring.

17:31.824 --> 17:33.264
What do you mean?

17:33.864 --> 17:35.043
It's boring to stay here.

17:35.044 --> 17:36.144
Don't you think so?

17:36.384 --> 17:37.384
I don't agree.

17:38.424 --> 17:39.784
Is it better than Shanghai?

17:41.944 --> 17:43.424
It has its own advantages.

17:43.784 --> 17:45.384
So does Shanghai.

17:46.024 --> 17:47.344
Don't kid me.

17:50.064 --> 17:51.384
Why haven't you had lunch?

17:53.264 --> 17:54.664
Your favorite soy milk.

17:55.624 --> 17:56.624
Enjoy it.

18:24.984 --> 18:30.704
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

18:32.824 --> 18:37.304
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

18:40.224 --> 18:45.584
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

18:46.824 --> 18:51.184
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

18:54.904 --> 18:59.704
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

19:02.304 --> 19:06.584
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

19:09.644 --> 19:15.664
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

19:16.244 --> 19:20.904
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

19:24.524 --> 19:29.824
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

19:31.204 --> 19:37.144
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

19:40.804 --> 19:43.704
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

19:45.764 --> 19:50.544
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

19:53.104 --> 19:57.023
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫

19:57.024 --> 19:58.664
[What life do I want?]

20:38.004 --> 20:41.024
[Galsang Flower Restaurant]

20:46.304 --> 20:47.944
[Poplar in the Water. Silver Fish.]

20:58.264 --> 20:59.464
Is it closed?

21:00.264 --> 21:01.264
Yes.

21:02.264 --> 21:03.944
Are you alone?

21:04.864 --> 21:06.424
Come in. We'll cook for you.

21:06.944 --> 21:07.423
This way.

21:07.424 --> 21:08.424
Thank you.

21:29.784 --> 21:30.944
Here's your dish.

21:34.864 --> 21:35.864
Come on.

21:36.504 --> 21:37.504
Are you hungry?

21:38.144 --> 21:39.383
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

21:39.384 --> 21:41.623
Madam,
can you take a photo of me?

21:41.624 --> 21:42.624
Okay.

21:42.984 --> 21:44.103
Just press here.

21:44.104 --> 21:45.104
Fine.

21:48.424 --> 21:50.064
One, two, three.

21:50.704 --> 21:51.744
Cheese.

21:53.184 --> 21:53.823
Check it.

21:53.824 --> 21:54.463
Thanks.

21:54.464 --> 21:56.003
Or I can snap another one.

21:56.004 --> 21:56.703
It's pretty nice.

21:56.704 --> 21:57.704
Thank you.

22:18.904 --> 22:20.184
Is it palatable?

22:25.184 --> 22:26.984
Do you come alone?

22:27.504 --> 22:28.783
Have you been here before?

22:28.784 --> 22:29.784
No.

22:30.024 --> 22:31.144
First come.

22:32.784 --> 22:34.183
You made a perfect choice.

22:34.184 --> 22:36.944
Our restaurant has
been open for 20 years.

22:37.184 --> 22:40.463
In the past,
it's the only restaurant here.

22:40.464 --> 22:44.264
All the tourists who eat
here will come back again.

23:07.944 --> 23:09.263
Madam.

23:09.264 --> 23:10.264
Bill, please.

23:11.104 --> 23:12.144
Can I use WeChat?

23:12.544 --> 23:13.944
Yes. Also Alipay.

23:14.464 --> 23:15.464
Scanner here.

23:16.624 --> 23:17.463
58.

23:17.464 --> 23:18.944
I think I should pay by card.

23:19.784 --> 23:21.183
Well, it's unavailable here.

23:21.184 --> 23:23.144
We all pay by phone.

23:23.504 --> 23:26.184
ATM around here?

23:26.704 --> 23:27.744
No.

23:29.784 --> 23:31.143
Just let it go.

23:31.144 --> 23:32.863
Let me treat you to a meal this time.

23:32.864 --> 23:35.543
- It doesn't matter.
- I can't do so.

23:35.544 --> 23:38.023
Do you know Youfeng Yard?

23:38.024 --> 23:38.623
Yes.

23:38.624 --> 23:39.744
Do you live there?

23:40.344 --> 23:42.783
I've just arrived here and
my phone was broken.

23:42.784 --> 23:44.743
I'll stay there for a few months.

23:44.744 --> 23:46.983
I'll pay you back
when I withdraw money tomorrow.

23:46.984 --> 23:48.943
Okay. It's not a big deal.

23:48.944 --> 23:50.823
Otherwise, shall I leave my camera here?

23:50.824 --> 23:51.663
No, thanks.

23:51.664 --> 23:52.663
It's no need.

23:52.664 --> 23:54.024
Don't mind me.

23:56.064 --> 23:57.063
I'll send it back.

23:57.064 --> 23:58.064
Fine.

23:58.504 --> 23:59.103
Take care.

23:59.104 --> 24:00.383
Thank you.

24:00.384 --> 24:01.464
- Goodbye.
- Bye.

24:16.804 --> 24:19.723
♫ Do you ever feel alone ♫

24:19.724 --> 24:22.184
♫ Stand in the road ♫

24:22.464 --> 24:25.184
♫ Don't know where to go ♫

24:27.244 --> 24:30.223
♫ In the air, my memory is flowing ♫

24:30.224 --> 24:33.143
♫ Faces in a row ♫

24:33.144 --> 24:35.744
♫ Take a long way home ♫

24:36.684 --> 24:43.423
♫ But all of this reminds me to believe ♫

24:43.424 --> 24:46.544
♫ no one stays or leaves ♫

24:47.184 --> 24:54.403
♫ And all of this reminds me to receive ♫

24:54.404 --> 24:57.344
♫ the life we can see ♫

25:03.444 --> 25:08.104
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

25:14.004 --> 25:18.904
♫ It's just another day ♫

25:25.484 --> 25:30.264
♫ It's just another day ♫

25:30.664 --> 25:33.663
The TV station will come to the embroidery workshop
to record program materials.

25:33.664 --> 25:35.863
Yue still undertakes it.

25:35.864 --> 25:37.944
I'll send you their phone number.

25:38.224 --> 25:39.103
Okay.

25:39.104 --> 25:40.023
President Xie.

25:40.024 --> 25:42.243
We've asked logistics to come tomorrow morning.

25:42.244 --> 25:43.663
All embroideries and goods

25:43.664 --> 25:45.503
for Xinjiang's intangible cultural heritage

25:45.504 --> 25:46.943
will be packed and sent tomorrow.

25:46.944 --> 25:48.304
I'm here to let you know.

25:49.264 --> 25:52.224
Could they come here a bit late?

25:52.464 --> 25:55.984
I want the program group to
shoot Ms. Xie's "Seven Horses".

25:56.504 --> 25:57.704
I'll tackle it.

25:58.744 --> 26:00.943
When will you and Zhang Xiaolan go to Xinjiang?

26:00.944 --> 26:02.503
The day after tomorrow.

26:02.504 --> 26:04.744
Ms. Zhang and her students can leave next week.

26:05.104 --> 26:06.104
OK.

26:06.384 --> 26:07.984
Settle it this way.

26:08.624 --> 26:10.343
Ye Sen. Where's the walnut?

26:10.344 --> 26:11.344
Here they are.

26:12.584 --> 26:13.664
Hand them out.

26:15.704 --> 26:16.543
Uncle.

26:16.544 --> 26:17.143
You're here.

26:17.144 --> 26:18.144
Yes.

26:19.744 --> 26:20.744
Let's go.

26:27.264 --> 26:28.264
Have a try.

26:29.064 --> 26:30.064
Here you are.

26:30.224 --> 26:31.704
Daxia, try some.

26:32.664 --> 26:33.824
From other provinces?

26:34.304 --> 26:35.943
Huang Xinxin's resource.

26:35.944 --> 26:37.503
The speciality of her friend's village.

26:37.504 --> 26:38.864
She wants us to help them sell the walnuts.

26:43.644 --> 26:44.704
What do you think?

26:45.704 --> 26:46.704
Not bad.

26:46.824 --> 26:47.800
Crisp.

26:47.824 --> 26:48.824
Full.

26:48.864 --> 26:50.984
But we need to see its origin.

26:51.584 --> 26:52.584
No problem.

26:57.904 --> 26:58.904
Uncle.

27:00.144 --> 27:00.743
Mr. Xie.

27:00.744 --> 27:01.743
Mr. Xie comes.

27:01.744 --> 27:02.864
Mr. Xie comes.

27:03.744 --> 27:04.983
Have some tea, please.

27:04.984 --> 27:05.984
Fine.

27:08.744 --> 27:09.744
Yao.

27:10.224 --> 27:14.664
I'm here to ask you something
about the wood carvings

27:14.924 --> 27:16.304
that the hotel wants.

27:16.664 --> 27:19.384
I thought to tell you when it's settled.

27:19.624 --> 27:20.624
Well...

27:20.864 --> 27:25.743
My designer friend told me
that the owner of the art hotel

27:25.744 --> 27:28.303
thought to hang a
wood carving painting

27:28.304 --> 27:29.824
at the doorway of each floor.

27:30.144 --> 27:32.464
Anyway, he now

27:32.904 --> 27:34.623
decides to hang a large-size

27:34.624 --> 27:36.423
wood carving painting in the hall.

27:36.424 --> 27:37.744
Craved by you.

27:38.024 --> 27:39.624
And the machine-made ones

27:39.984 --> 27:41.303
for the rest floors.

27:41.304 --> 27:43.304
So it can cut costs.

27:47.144 --> 27:49.224
So he only needs one, right?

27:51.144 --> 27:52.144
Well...

27:52.624 --> 27:53.784
Can others carve it?

27:54.504 --> 27:58.544
As you're the inheritor,
of course, he wants your work.

27:58.984 --> 28:01.464
My apprentices also carve pretty well.

28:02.224 --> 28:05.183
If it were in the past,
people who wanted to build houses

28:05.184 --> 28:07.383
would have to wait
in line to hire them.

28:07.384 --> 28:08.383
I know.

28:08.384 --> 28:09.103
Uncle.

28:09.104 --> 28:10.703
It's not determined yet.

28:10.704 --> 28:13.503
I'll ask my friend to make
an appointment with him.

28:13.504 --> 28:15.584
I'll try to communicate with him again.

28:20.664 --> 28:21.664
Forget it.

28:22.784 --> 28:23.904
Don't try again.

28:24.184 --> 28:26.544
I don't want to beg others.

28:27.304 --> 28:29.503
Just tell him...

28:29.504 --> 28:30.583
Well...

28:30.584 --> 28:31.983
Ask him to find another one

28:31.984 --> 28:33.504
to carve the painting.

28:34.224 --> 28:35.303
I don't need it.

28:35.304 --> 28:37.304
Wait. It's not begging him.

28:37.744 --> 28:39.544
Business needs communications.

28:39.984 --> 28:43.224
We need to persuade each
other by our own conditions.

28:43.984 --> 28:46.383
I've never begged
others in earning money.

28:46.384 --> 28:47.783
I only depend on my skills.

28:47.784 --> 28:49.424
I won't beg others.

28:51.064 --> 28:52.343
Yao, I'm not angry at you.

28:52.344 --> 28:53.344
Don't mention it.

28:53.744 --> 28:55.064
Forget the matter.

28:55.304 --> 28:56.304
I have to go.

28:56.904 --> 28:58.343
Don't leave so fast.

28:58.344 --> 28:59.143
Forget it.

28:59.144 --> 29:00.144
Wait.

29:43.344 --> 29:44.344
Excuse me.

29:44.864 --> 29:46.104
I want to ask the way.

29:52.504 --> 29:53.984
Why do you come here?

29:54.984 --> 29:56.663
Just walk around.

29:56.664 --> 29:58.624
Well, see you again.

29:59.184 --> 30:01.264
It's easy to meet in a small place.

30:01.904 --> 30:03.384
Are you going back to the yard?

30:05.744 --> 30:08.103
Walk along this way to the seaside.

30:08.104 --> 30:10.103
And then,
go along the highway near the sea.

30:10.104 --> 30:12.063
Then you can see the entrance of the village.

30:12.064 --> 30:13.544
I see. Thank you.

30:19.464 --> 30:20.464
What's wrong?

30:24.904 --> 30:26.504
Are you bitten by a snake?

30:36.664 --> 30:38.503
Why are you staring at it?

30:38.504 --> 30:39.864
Haven't you seen it before?

30:41.724 --> 30:43.184
Never stepped on it before.

30:55.944 --> 30:59.184
What about pulling out your foot
from the manure first?

31:30.584 --> 31:31.824
First time riding it?

31:32.464 --> 31:33.464
Yes.

31:34.224 --> 31:35.224
Take it easy.

31:35.504 --> 31:37.104
Lil Cute is docile.

31:37.424 --> 31:39.943
Yuan hurt it with firecrackers.

31:39.944 --> 31:41.424
That's why it doesn't like him.

31:43.464 --> 31:44.824
It's called "Lil Cute"?

31:45.464 --> 31:46.863
It was tiny when it was born.

31:46.864 --> 31:47.864
So lovely.

31:50.344 --> 31:51.344
Thank you.

31:52.424 --> 31:53.424
Never mind.

31:54.144 --> 31:56.703
It's a good omen to step on cow dung.

31:56.704 --> 31:58.744
Maybe I could
benefit from your luck.

32:02.144 --> 32:03.504
Did you come here after resigning?

32:04.464 --> 32:05.664
How do you know that?

32:06.104 --> 32:07.783
Live here for three months...

32:07.784 --> 32:09.664
Which firm can let you rest for so long?

32:10.024 --> 32:12.223
How do you know I'll live here for three months?

32:12.224 --> 32:14.824
Youfeng Yard needs to
rent for three months at least.

32:15.664 --> 32:16.664
It's right.

32:17.944 --> 32:20.304
Breaking up or feeling confused?

32:22.264 --> 32:23.664
Why do you ask so?

32:24.344 --> 32:27.984
Love or business,
people always care about them.

32:29.864 --> 32:32.984
Youngsters in big cities are always like this.

32:33.504 --> 32:35.383
They think they're under huge pressure.

32:35.384 --> 32:36.943
Work more but earn less.

32:36.944 --> 32:38.384
And their boss is just a fool.

32:39.344 --> 32:42.864
Though they complain every day,
few people will resign.

32:43.184 --> 32:44.623
Do you know why?

32:44.624 --> 32:45.624
Why?

32:45.864 --> 32:47.863
Because they still need
to find another job then.

32:47.864 --> 32:49.703
No job, no money.

32:49.704 --> 32:52.304
No money, no future.

32:54.144 --> 32:55.144
Well...

32:55.504 --> 32:57.983
Can raising horses support your family?

32:57.984 --> 32:59.183
Yes.

32:59.184 --> 33:01.703
We have houses and
lands with low cost.

33:01.704 --> 33:05.303
My granny grows vegetables
and sells goods in a booth.

33:05.304 --> 33:06.743
She can earn dozens a day.

33:06.744 --> 33:11.224
If I do nothing,
her money is enough to support us all.

33:12.744 --> 33:14.544
So how old is she?

33:15.064 --> 33:17.424
She's just 80 this year.

33:23.904 --> 33:26.184
The sun is going down.

33:32.904 --> 33:36.344
♫ Sunset glow flushes the sky ♫

33:37.064 --> 33:39.584
♫ The sea confronts the wind ♫

33:40.344 --> 33:43.064
♫ How mild the sunset is ♫

33:45.944 --> 33:49.704
♫ Mountains hide behind the clouds ♫

33:50.204 --> 33:52.904
♫ Show me a dream ♫

33:53.724 --> 33:57.144
♫ Meet with the stars ♫

33:58.284 --> 34:05.424
♫ When the wind blows away
the provisional immortal ♫

34:06.884 --> 34:10.464
♫ and busy daytime ♫

34:11.824 --> 34:18.864
♫ I close my eyes to know why to breathe ♫

34:20.164 --> 34:23.744
♫ I'm holding your hand ♫

34:31.584 --> 34:37.424
♫ At the end of the world ♫

34:45.284 --> 34:50.264
♫ Everything is behind me ♫

34:51.944 --> 34:52.423
Take it.

34:52.424 --> 34:53.664
Be careful.

34:57.144 --> 34:58.144
Watch out.

35:02.864 --> 35:03.864
Sit there.

35:12.384 --> 35:13.384
Qin.

35:13.824 --> 35:14.824
Slippers, please.

35:15.784 --> 35:16.783
Yao.

35:16.784 --> 35:17.863
Your girlfriend?

35:17.864 --> 35:19.663
Are you kidding?

35:19.664 --> 35:21.904
She's just a visitor.

35:23.064 --> 35:25.103
How can she ride Lil Cute?

35:25.104 --> 35:27.224
You didn't allow
me to ride last time.

35:29.104 --> 35:30.704
Choose one.

35:31.624 --> 35:32.704
This one, please.

35:34.784 --> 35:35.784
Suit you?

35:35.864 --> 35:36.583
Yes.

35:36.584 --> 35:37.343
How much?

35:37.344 --> 35:40.464
You come with him so I
won't earn your money. 25.

35:40.864 --> 35:41.823
10.

35:41.824 --> 35:44.184
Then I can earn nothing!

35:45.944 --> 35:46.944
Fine, 10 yuan.

35:51.864 --> 35:53.103
Why are you paying for it?

35:53.104 --> 35:54.104
Her...

35:54.384 --> 35:56.664
What does it have to do with you?

35:58.624 --> 36:00.663
Let me remove the tag for you.

36:00.664 --> 36:01.664
Fine.

36:02.544 --> 36:04.224
Yao!

36:05.544 --> 36:06.823
Impolite!

36:06.824 --> 36:09.823
According to the clan rank,
you should call me "Uncle Yao".

36:09.824 --> 36:10.783
Uncle?

36:10.784 --> 36:11.543
It's a modern world.

36:11.544 --> 36:12.983
We don't call it like that.

36:12.984 --> 36:14.504
And you're not my real uncle.

36:15.144 --> 36:16.144
Your shoes.

36:18.144 --> 36:19.144
See you.

36:19.264 --> 36:20.264
Hold on.

36:20.824 --> 36:21.824
Here you are.

36:23.264 --> 36:24.263
Thank you so much.

36:24.264 --> 36:25.743
Come and play as you're free.

36:25.744 --> 36:26.744
Bye.

36:27.024 --> 36:27.783
Yao!

36:27.784 --> 36:28.943
I'll go to find you tomorrow!

36:28.944 --> 36:29.944
OK.

36:31.304 --> 36:33.063
Hello. Have you eaten?

36:33.064 --> 36:33.863
Not yet.

36:33.864 --> 36:34.583
You're just back?

36:34.584 --> 36:35.343
Yes.

36:35.344 --> 36:36.303
Why are you going?

36:36.304 --> 36:37.623
Go to pick up my granny.

36:37.624 --> 36:39.304
I see. Take care.

36:44.584 --> 36:46.344
You don't adjust it?

36:53.624 --> 36:54.624
Guanjun.

36:55.664 --> 36:56.664
Granny.

36:57.064 --> 36:59.344
Don't embroider in the dark. Your eyes.

36:59.664 --> 37:01.103
Why do you come so late?

37:01.104 --> 37:02.824
She's waiting here for a while.

37:03.744 --> 37:05.704
Is she your friend?

37:06.624 --> 37:08.744
The new tenant of the yard, Xu Hongdou.

37:08.984 --> 37:09.503
Hello.

37:09.504 --> 37:10.904
You've stayed here for a long time?

37:11.424 --> 37:13.143
I'm here at six o'clock every evening.

37:13.144 --> 37:14.663
The barbecue is right here.

37:14.664 --> 37:15.664
I see.

37:17.664 --> 37:18.784
Let me help you.

37:19.784 --> 37:20.784
Fine.

37:21.544 --> 37:22.543
It's a good boy.

37:22.544 --> 37:23.544
Won't kick you.

37:24.344 --> 37:25.464
Let me help you.

37:26.944 --> 37:28.064
Try some.

37:28.384 --> 37:28.943
No, thanks.

37:28.944 --> 37:30.103
It doesn't matter.

37:30.104 --> 37:31.104
Fine, thanks.

37:35.344 --> 37:36.344
Let's go.

37:36.664 --> 37:38.544
I don't know how to lead it.

37:38.864 --> 37:40.103
It's just fine.

37:40.104 --> 37:41.983
If not, granny can hold it.

37:41.984 --> 37:42.663
Come on.

37:42.664 --> 37:43.223
Never mind.

37:43.224 --> 37:44.504
I can do it.

37:45.024 --> 37:46.024
Let's go.

37:47.744 --> 37:49.264
How much did you earn today?

37:49.864 --> 37:50.983
Over 100.

37:50.984 --> 37:52.144
So much.

37:53.504 --> 37:54.784
Beef and mutton ribs.

37:55.104 --> 37:56.104
OK.

37:58.264 --> 37:59.063
Granny.

37:59.064 --> 38:00.023
Let me wash it.

38:00.024 --> 38:01.143
I can do it.

38:01.144 --> 38:02.823
Go to have some tea.

38:02.824 --> 38:03.503
Hurry.

38:03.504 --> 38:04.944
Rest for a while.

38:06.384 --> 38:07.384
Xu Hongdou.

38:07.784 --> 38:08.863
Help me serve dishes.

38:08.864 --> 38:09.864
Okay.

38:20.924 --> 38:22.043
Just some homemade dishes.

38:22.044 --> 38:23.044
Enjoy it.

38:24.664 --> 38:25.703
Thank you.

38:25.704 --> 38:27.103
Don't you need to wait Yuan?

38:27.104 --> 38:28.023
Ignore him.

38:28.024 --> 38:29.544
Maybe he's playing outside.

38:33.424 --> 38:34.424
Yao.

38:36.064 --> 38:36.823
Aunt Baoping.

38:36.824 --> 38:37.984
We're in the room!

38:41.264 --> 38:42.264
Our neighbor.

38:44.424 --> 38:45.424
Aunt.

38:45.904 --> 38:47.943
My relative has a wedding
so I stewed some beef.

38:47.944 --> 38:49.744
Then bring some to you.

38:49.984 --> 38:50.903
Beef!

38:50.904 --> 38:51.903
Great!

38:51.904 --> 38:54.224
We have a guest but
have no decent dish.

38:55.384 --> 38:55.783
Hello.

38:55.784 --> 38:56.784
Hello.

38:57.944 --> 38:59.144
The new tenant of the yard.

38:59.984 --> 39:00.863
Baoping.

39:00.864 --> 39:02.864
Come and eat with us.

39:03.144 --> 39:04.423
Our meal is ready too.

39:04.424 --> 39:06.303
Xiaochun went to call Hulu back.

39:06.304 --> 39:07.743
And I'll be back.

39:07.744 --> 39:09.384
Try some. It's still warm.

39:09.984 --> 39:10.783
Thank you.

39:10.784 --> 39:12.423
Have your meal first.

39:12.424 --> 39:13.503
I have to leave.

39:13.504 --> 39:14.744
Thank you, aunt.

39:15.384 --> 39:16.423
Aunt, I'm leaving.

39:16.424 --> 39:17.423
Aunt Baoping.

39:17.424 --> 39:18.544
Let me see you off.

39:22.344 --> 39:23.344
Try some.

39:23.744 --> 39:24.983
Don't wait for him.

39:24.984 --> 39:25.984
Thank you.

39:28.264 --> 39:29.304
Aunt Baoping.

39:30.304 --> 39:31.464
What's going on?

39:32.664 --> 39:34.944
I hope you can persuade Xiaxia.

39:35.384 --> 39:36.384
What's wrong?

39:37.264 --> 39:40.423
He's quite impulsive
and lazy at work now.

39:40.424 --> 39:42.863
He drove his master angry again.

39:42.864 --> 39:44.823
He refused to hear Xiaochun's comments

39:44.824 --> 39:47.144
and they quarreled at home.

39:47.984 --> 39:49.983
Youngsters always fidget.

39:49.984 --> 39:51.784
Everyone loves playing, right?

39:52.464 --> 39:55.583
As uncle has blamed him,
you shouldn't blame him again.

39:55.584 --> 39:56.503
I know.

39:56.504 --> 39:58.223
But he's different this time.

39:58.224 --> 40:01.503
He told me his friend in
Shanghai invited him to play

40:01.504 --> 40:02.944
so he wanted to go to Shanghai.

40:03.984 --> 40:05.743
When did he have such a friend?

40:05.744 --> 40:06.823
I don't know.

40:06.824 --> 40:10.504
He holds his phone to scan
short videos or chat every day.

40:10.984 --> 40:13.143
I don't mean to
forbid him to play.

40:13.144 --> 40:15.664
I'm just afraid he
won't come back.

40:16.064 --> 40:17.503
Did he tell you?

40:17.504 --> 40:19.143
No.

40:19.144 --> 40:20.783
But I know him well.

40:20.784 --> 40:24.743
He told me two days ago that
his master's latest apprentice

40:24.744 --> 40:26.624
wanted to leave.

40:26.864 --> 40:28.423
Another one wants to leave?

40:28.424 --> 40:29.584
Yes.

40:29.824 --> 40:32.623
Doors and windows are
carved by machines now.

40:32.624 --> 40:35.223
Even senior craftsmen
have few jobs.

40:35.224 --> 40:37.543
Many students decide to leave.

40:37.544 --> 40:40.304
The rest become more and more unsettled.

40:42.184 --> 40:43.984
I see.

40:44.504 --> 40:46.223
Aunt Baoping, take it easy.

40:46.224 --> 40:47.863
I'll discuss it with Xiaochun first.

40:47.864 --> 40:49.223
Then I'll ask Xiaxia.

40:49.224 --> 40:51.103
Sorry for troubling you again.

40:51.104 --> 40:51.823
Never mind.

40:51.824 --> 40:52.863
Then I'm leaving now.

40:52.864 --> 40:55.264
Don't forget tomorrow's issue.

40:55.904 --> 40:56.904
I won't.

40:57.144 --> 40:57.783
That's fine.

40:57.784 --> 40:58.623
See you.

40:58.624 --> 40:59.983
Leave you to dine.

40:59.984 --> 41:00.863
Take your time.

41:00.864 --> 41:01.263
I see.

41:01.264 --> 41:02.704
Take care!

41:12.504 --> 41:13.303
That's it.

41:13.304 --> 41:15.224
Just to tell you my phone is broken.

41:17.504 --> 41:19.304
I was dining at my friend's home.

41:21.544 --> 41:22.343
Mom.

41:22.344 --> 41:25.064
My vacation is on from tomorrow.

41:25.664 --> 41:27.024
Nothing. Just have a rest.

41:28.424 --> 41:29.223
Mom.

41:29.224 --> 41:29.983
I have to hang up.

41:29.984 --> 41:32.223
I need to give back the phone.

41:32.224 --> 41:33.544
That's all. Bye.

41:48.304 --> 41:49.944
Let me send you back.

41:50.384 --> 41:51.783
No, thanks. It's quite close.

41:51.784 --> 41:53.063
I can go myself.

41:53.064 --> 41:54.344
Do you have cash?

41:56.784 --> 41:57.784
No.

42:01.064 --> 42:01.783
Take it.

42:01.784 --> 42:02.583
For urgent need.

42:02.584 --> 42:02.983
Thank you.

42:02.984 --> 42:04.023
I'll pay it back.

42:04.024 --> 42:05.903
After your phone is fixed.

42:05.904 --> 42:06.904
Let's go.

42:07.464 --> 42:09.383
I need to go to Galsang Flower Restaurant.

42:09.384 --> 42:10.864
Are you still hungry?

42:11.184 --> 42:12.903
No. I had lunch on credit.

42:12.904 --> 42:14.584
I'm now to pay it back.

42:15.344 --> 42:16.704
In such a hurry?

42:17.064 --> 42:18.604
Then I could be at ease.

42:19.064 --> 42:20.064
Fine.

42:21.944 --> 42:23.144
Beware of the stairs.

42:24.824 --> 42:30.304
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

42:32.264 --> 42:37.224
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

42:39.664 --> 42:45.744
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

42:46.064 --> 42:51.424
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

42:54.384 --> 42:59.784
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:01.744 --> 43:06.624
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

43:09.184 --> 43:15.384
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

43:15.704 --> 43:21.904
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:23.984 --> 43:30.423
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

43:30.424 --> 43:37.184
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

43:38.584 --> 43:40.623
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

43:40.624 --> 43:45.024
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

43:45.264 --> 43:52.464
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

